सात्त्विकी राजसी चैव तामसी चेति तां श‍ृणु ॥ २ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4275,\"bb\":3758,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/2/b3758/\",\"body_value\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca
