tān viddhy āsura-niścayān\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4298,\"bb\":3778,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/5-6/b3778/\",\"shadow_value\":\"aśāstra – not in the scriptures; vihitam – directed; ghoram – harmful to others; tapyante – undergo; ye – those who; tapaḥ – austerities; janāḥ – persons; dambha – with pride; ahaṅkāra – and egoism; saṁyuktāḥ – engaged; kāma – of lust; rāga – and attachment; bala – by the force; anvitāḥ – impelled; karṣayantaḥ – tormenting; śarīra-stham – situated within the body; bhūta-grāmam – the combination of material elements; acetasaḥ – having a misled mentality; mām – Me; ca – also; eva – certainly; antaḥ – within; śarīra-stham – situated in the body; tān – them; viddhi – understand; āsura-niścayān – demons.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"aśāstra\",\"translation\":\"not in the scriptures\"},{\"word\":\"vihitam\",\"translation\":\"directed\"},{\"word\":\"ghoram\",\"translation\":\"harmful to others\"},{\"word\":\"tapyante\",\"translation\":\"undergo\"},{\"word\":\"ye\",\"translation\":\"those who\"},{\"word\":\"tapaḥ\",\"translation\":\"austerities\"},{\"word\":\"janāḥ\",\"translation\":\"persons\"},{\"word\":\"dambha\",\"translation\":\"with pride\"},{\"word\":\"ahaṅkāra\",\"translation\":\"and egoism\"},{\"word\":\"saṁyuktāḥ\",\"translation\":\"engaged\"},{\"word\":\"kāma\",\"translation\":\"of lust\"},{\"word\":\"rāga\",\"translation\":\"and attachment\"},{\"word\":\"bala\",\"translation\":\"by the force\"},{\"word\":\"anvitāḥ\",\"translation\":\"impelled\"},{\"word\":\"karṣayantaḥ\",\"translation\":\"tormenting\"},{\"word\":\"śarīra-stham\",\"translation\":\"situated within the body\"},{\"word\":\"bhūta-grāmam\",\"translation\":\"the combination of material elements\"},{\"word\":\"acetasaḥ\",\"translation\":\"having a misled mentality\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"antaḥ\",\"translation\":\"within\"},{\"word\":\"śarīra-stham\",\"translation\":\"situated in the body\"},{\"word\":\"tān\",\"translation\":\"them\"},{\"word\":\"viddhi\",\"translation\":\"understand\"},{\"word\":\"āsura-niścayān\",\"translation\":\"demons\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4299,\"bb\":3779,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/5-6/b3779/\",\"body_value\":\"Those who undergo severe austerities and penances not recommended in the scriptures, performing them out of pride and egoism, who are impelled by lust and attachment, who are foolish and who torture the material elements of the body as well as the Supersoul dwelling within, are to be known as demons.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4300,\"bb\":3780,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/5-6/b3780/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 17.5-6\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 17.5-6\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo